{"logId": "210f412c-d8e2-4d8d-8473-b25943bde882", "result": {"layoutParsingResults": [{"prunedResult": {"page_count": null, "width": 2800, "height": 2000, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 员工因病请假7天以上的，由本人持医疗单位证明，经部门主管审批后，报公司备案，方可休假。", "block_bbox": [292, 84, 2195, 137], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[292.0, 84.0], [2195.0, 84.0], [2195.0, 137.0], [292.0, 137.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 病假期间，扣发相对应的日工资。", "block_bbox": [295, 152, 998, 203], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[295.0, 152.0], [998.0, 152.0], [998.0, 203.0], [295.0, 203.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4. 病假到期未办理续假手续和应到而未到岗的员工，按自动离职处理。", "block_bbox": [293, 220, 1651, 272], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[293.0, 220.0], [1651.0, 220.0], [1651.0, 272.0], [293.0, 272.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5. 病假超过3个月者由区域经理批准。", "block_bbox": [298, 288, 1013, 338], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[298.0, 288.0], [1013.0, 288.0], [1013.0, 338.0], [298.0, 338.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "五、事假", "block_bbox": [218, 356, 409, 405], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 356.0], [409.0, 356.0], [409.0, 405.0], [218.0, 405.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 事假1天扣发相对应的日工资。", "block_bbox": [296, 423, 925, 473], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[296.0, 423.0], [925.0, 423.0], [925.0, 473.0], [296.0, 473.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 事假连续5天以上者，视为自动离职。特殊情况，由区域经理批准，上报公司。", "block_bbox": [295, 491, 1846, 541], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[295.0, 491.0], [1846.0, 491.0], [1846.0, 541.0], [295.0, 541.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "六、年休假", "block_bbox": [217, 558, 454, 607], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[217.0, 558.0], [454.0, 558.0], [454.0, 607.0], [217.0, 607.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "在公司工作一定年限（工龄）的员工，每年可享有一次连续带薪年休假，标准如下：", "block_bbox": [295, 625, 1914, 676], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[295.0, 625.0], [1914.0, 625.0], [1914.0, 676.0], [295.0, 676.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 在公司连续工龄满——五年，可享有5天。", "block_bbox": [297, 694, 1148, 743], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[297.0, 694.0], [1148.0, 694.0], [1148.0, 743.0], [297.0, 743.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "2. 在公司连续工龄满六一十年，可享有7天。", "block_bbox": [296, 762, 1146, 811], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[296.0, 762.0], [1146.0, 762.0], [1146.0, 811.0], [296.0, 811.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "3. 在公司连续工龄满十年以上，可享有10天。", "block_bbox": [296, 829, 1167, 878], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[296.0, 829.0], [1167.0, 829.0], [1167.0, 878.0], [296.0, 878.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "4. 年休假允许拆零休假，时间按天计算，不足一天按一天计算。", "block_bbox": [294, 896, 1519, 947], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[294.0, 896.0], [1519.0, 896.0], [1519.0, 947.0], [294.0, 947.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "5. 有下述情况的不能休年休假：", "block_bbox": [298, 964, 907, 1014], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[298.0, 964.0], [907.0, 964.0], [907.0, 1014.0], [298.0, 1014.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "孕休上岗未满一年者；", "block_bbox": [350, 1032, 784, 1082], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[350.0, 1032.0], [784.0, 1032.0], [784.0, 1082.0], [350.0, 1082.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "累计病假30天以上：", "block_bbox": [354, 1100, 739, 1150], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[354.0, 1100.0], [739.0, 1100.0], [739.0, 1150.0], [354.0, 1150.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "累计事假12天以上。", "block_bbox": [353, 1167, 736, 1218], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[353.0, 1167.0], [736.0, 1167.0], [736.0, 1218.0], [353.0, 1218.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "第十章 培训", "block_bbox": [1354, 1299, 1711, 1359], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[1354.0, 1299.0], [1711.0, 1299.0], [1711.0, 1359.0], [1354.0, 1359.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "一、培训方式", "block_bbox": [212, 1437, 499, 1487], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[212.0, 1437.0], [499.0, 1437.0], [499.0, 1487.0], [212.0, 1487.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "进入公司之前由人力资源部培训考核，进入公司之后由上级主管部门逐级进行培训考核。", "block_bbox": [291, 1505, 2002, 1556], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[291.0, 1505.0], [2002.0, 1505.0], [2002.0, 1556.0], [291.0, 1556.0]]}, {"block_label": "paragraph_title", "block_content": "二、培训政策", "block_bbox": [218, 1572, 498, 1622], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[218.0, 1572.0], [498.0, 1572.0], [498.0, 1622.0], [218.0, 1622.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "1. 学习新技能并培训他人是绝对有必要性的，以便：", "block_bbox": [295, 1640, 1299, 1690], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[295.0, 1640.0], [1299.0, 1640.0], [1299.0, 1690.0], [295.0, 1690.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "加强我们在各个部门与职位上的专业性", "block_bbox": [341, 1709, 1147, 1758], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[341.0, 1709.0], [1147.0, 1709.0], [1147.0, 1758.0], [341.0, 1758.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "分享经验和技能", "block_bbox": [342, 1776, 709, 1825], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[342.0, 1776.0], [709.0, 1776.0], [709.0, 1825.0], [342.0, 1825.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "24", "block_bbox": [123, 1938, 178, 1971], "block_id": 24, "block_order": null, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[123.0, 1938.0], [178.0, 1938.0], [178.0, 1971.0], [123.0, 1971.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"boxes": [{"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8695323467254639, "coordinate": [292, 84, 2195, 137], "order": 1, "polygon_points": [[292.0, 84.0], [2195.0, 84.0], [2195.0, 137.0], [292.0, 137.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8611254692077637, "coordinate": [295, 152, 998, 203], "order": 2, "polygon_points": [[295.0, 152.0], [998.0, 152.0], [998.0, 203.0], [295.0, 203.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8774251341819763, "coordinate": [293, 220, 1651, 272], "order": 3, "polygon_points": [[293.0, 220.0], [1651.0, 220.0], [1651.0, 272.0], [293.0, 272.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8600909113883972, "coordinate": [298, 288, 1013, 338], "order": 4, "polygon_points": [[298.0, 288.0], [1013.0, 288.0], [1013.0, 338.0], [298.0, 338.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8639063239097595, "coordinate": [218, 356, 409, 405], "order": 5, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 356.0], [409.0, 356.0], [409.0, 405.0], [218.0, 405.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8590500950813293, "coordinate": [296, 423, 925, 473], "order": 6, "polygon_points": [[296.0, 423.0], [925.0, 423.0], [925.0, 473.0], [296.0, 473.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score":