61096191, "coordinate": [353, 1167, 736, 1218], "order": 17, "polygon_points": [[353.0, 1167.0], [736.0, 1167.0], [736.0, 1218.0], [353.0, 1218.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8856261372566223, "coordinate": [1354, 1299, 1711, 1359], "order": 18, "polygon_points": [[1354.0, 1299.0], [1711.0, 1299.0], [1711.0, 1359.0], [1354.0, 1359.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8501936197280884, "coordinate": [212, 1437, 499, 1487], "order": 19, "polygon_points": [[212.0, 1437.0], [499.0, 1437.0], [499.0, 1487.0], [212.0, 1487.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8840351104736328, "coordinate": [291, 1505, 2002, 1556], "order": 20, "polygon_points": [[291.0, 1505.0], [2002.0, 1505.0], [2002.0, 1556.0], [291.0, 1556.0]]}, {"cls_id": 17, "label": "paragraph_title", "score": 0.8619657754898071, "coordinate": [218, 1572, 498, 1622], "order": 21, "polygon_points": [[218.0, 1572.0], [498.0, 1572.0], [498.0, 1622.0], [218.0, 1622.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8648605942726135, "coordinate": [295, 1640, 1299, 1690], "order": 22, "polygon_points": [[295.0, 1640.0], [1299.0, 1640.0], [1299.0, 1690.0], [295.0, 1690.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8629072904586792, "coordinate": [341, 1709, 1147, 1758], "order": 23, "polygon_points": [[341.0, 1709.0], [1147.0, 1709.0], [1147.0, 1758.0], [341.0, 1758.0]]}, {"cls_id": 22, "label": "text", "score": 0.8430647253990173, "coordinate": [342, 1776, 709, 1825], "order": 24, "polygon_points": [[342.0, 1776.0], [709.0, 1776.0], [709.0, 1825.0], [342.0, 1825.0]]}, {"cls_id": 16, "label": "number", "score": 0.7316822409629822, "coordinate": [123, 1938, 178, 1971], "order": 25, "polygon_points": [[123.0, 1938.0], [178.0, 1938.0], [178.0, 1971.0], [123.0, 1971.0]]}]}}, "markdown": {"text": "2. 员工因病请假7天以上的，由本人持医疗单位证明，经部门主管审批后，报公司备案，方可休假。\n\n3. 病假期间，扣发相对应的日工资。\n\n4. 病假到期未办理续假手续和应到而未到岗的员工，按自动离职处理。\n\n5. 病假超过3个月者由区域经理批准。\n\n## 五、 事假\n\n1. 事假1天扣发相对应的日工资。\n\n2. 事假连续5天以上者，视为自动离职。特殊情况，由区域经理批准，上报公司。\n\n## 六、 年休假\n\n在公司工作一定年限（工龄）的员工，每年可享有一次连续带薪年休假，标准如下：\n\n1. 在公司连续工龄满——五年，可享有5天。\n\n2. 在公司连续工龄满六一十年，可享有7天。\n\n3. 在公司连续工龄满十年以上，可享有10天。\n\n4. 年休假允许拆零休假，时间按天计算，不足一天按一天计算。\n\n5. 有下述情况的不能休年休假：\n\n孕休上岗未满一年者；\n\n累计病假30天以上：\n\n累计事假12天以上。\n\n## 第十章 培训\n\n## 一、 培训方式\n\n进入公司之前由人力资源部培训考核，进入公司之后由上级主管部门逐级进行培训考核。\n\n## 二、 培训政策\n\n1. 学习新技能并培训他人是绝对有必要性的，以便：\n\n加强我们在各个部门与职位上的专业性\n\n分享经验和技能", "images": {}}, "outputImages": {"layout_det_res": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//210f412c-d8e2-4d8d-8473-b25943bde882/layout_det_res_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A39%3A03Z%2F-1%2F%2F6d3e987285fe52bd3ddea7462f5f87e46ef182f5723a91813ee9a04796b1528f"}, "inputImage": "https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//210f412c-d8e2-4d8d-8473-b25943bde882/input_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A39%3A03Z%2F-1%2F%2F99a903f6e43786f4faded7c061a600dddd66d977ff4df85707e43e4c53fae44f"}], "dataInfo": {"numPages": 1, "pages": [{"width": 2800, "height": 2000}], "type": "pdf"}, "preprocessedImages": ["https://pplines-online.bj.bcebos.com/deploy/official/paddleocr/pp-ocr-vl-16-online//210f412c-d8e2-4d8d-8473-b25943bde882/preprocessed_img_0.jpg?authorization=bce-auth-v1%2FALTAKDN8mY5KlNI7zaRpLmOqrw%2F2026-08-09T09%3A39%3A03Z%2F-1%2F%2F228f815901d19481670f8b9af8b528e078a2a9c7360727d637e4d9cbe17fa32d"]}, "errorCode": 0, "errorMsg": "Success"}
